        <p>We have to announce that in future this column will be discontinued. We shall, however be pleased to publish any reports of the matches, etc. concern- ing the game, that may be forwarded to us. In con- nection with the solvinz competition to competi- tors, 14r E Ogden, Liverpool-road, and Mr T Rickers 48, Elizabeth-atrest have tied for first place. We have therefore decided to divide the prize between these two, instead of resorting to the ballot, as has been customary on previous occasions. Accordingly the sum of 2a M has been forwarded to each of them.</p>
