        <p>„.... and scales, and , gentle anointings with CUTICITRA Ointment soothe and heal itching, burning skin. spid everywhn,,e. Forlen depots: F. NFWBEKT k Soys,Len. don ; ;Amy, Pules R. TOWN &amp; Co, Sydney. PoTmE, Dun; Con?, Sole Prop:. Boston, U. S. A.</p>
