        <p>VERO'S LIGHTNING COUGH CURE Is the most succe4sful remedy in kngland. vastly superior to the host of common, cheap couch mixtures or any of the emulAons. It cures !--18 if by some mysterious pow r, even in seemingb, hopeless cases. Ask for VENO'S LIGHTNING COUGH CURE,tUd see you get it. Is. 10. and 28. 9d. Solo by Boots, Ltd., lintiwies, Warrington ; Pealce, Err!es- town and Newton; Weston and Co„ Ituncoru ; Foggitt, Widu es ; and all Chemists,</p>
